                "type": "text",
                "text": "“Hello, Greenfield Sports Centre. — Hi, I'd like to join the swimming club. — Sure. Can I take your name? — Yes, it's Daniel Okoro. That's O-K-O-R-O. — And your phone number? — 07945 318 226. — Thanks. Membership is £35 a month, or £360 for a full year. Which would you prefer? — The annual one, please. — Great. Our beginners' sessions are on Wednesday evenings at 7. Please bring a swimming cap; they're compulsory in the pool. — OK. And where do I park? — There's free parking behind the tennis courts.”"
